        "claim_details": [
          {
            "text": "EventSource 会自动建立持久连接，并在连接断开时自动重连。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "自动重连具有可调的重连超时。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "重连时，浏览器 EventSource 会在 Last-Event-ID 请求头中发送最后收到的事件 ID。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "设置事件的 id 值会使 EventSource 的 lastEventId 属性更新为该值。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "服务端可依据 Last-Event-ID 重发后续消息。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "HTML 标准将 Last-Event-ID 描述为基本可为任意 UTF-8 编码字符串，但不得包含 U+0000 NULL、U+000A LF 或 U+000D CR。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "HTML 标准指出 Last-Event-ID 的值空间仍需通过 issue 7363 更好地定义。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "SSE 事件流的 MIME 类型是 text/event-stream。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "SSE 事件可包含 id、event、data 和 retry 字段，空行会派发组装好的事件。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "EventSource 通过 readyState 属性暴露当前状态。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "在 HTML 标准的 fail the connection 流程中，用户代理会排队任务，在 readyState 不是 CLOSED 时将其设为 CLOSED 并触发 error 事件。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 0.3,
            "supported": false
          },
          {
            "text": "一篇测试文章将正确的重连契约表述为：下一次连接应标识最后已完整处理的事件，并由服务器按文档化的重放策略恢复。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 0.3,
            "supported": false
          },
          {
            "text": "一篇社区资料表示服务器应使用 Last-Event-ID 从正确位置恢复事件流。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": false,
            "method": "lexical",
            "support": null,
            "supported": false
          },
          {
            "text": "一篇文章称重连时间由实现决定，通常为几秒钟。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": false,
            "method": "lexical",
            "support": null,
            "supported": false
          },
          {
            "text": "浏览器在 SSE 重连时会回传此前存储的 Last-Event-ID。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "SSE 事件的 id 字段会被浏览器 EventSource API 存储，并在重连时作为 Last-Event-ID 发送。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "服务端可利用 Last-Event-ID 在缓冲区中定位后续事件并从该位置继续发送。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "Galaxy 文档称重连后服务端会重放自该时间点以来的聚合 notification_status。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "Galaxy 文档称历史更新在 payload 中带有 update_time 游标，客户端可据此请求增量。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "重放边界策略存在差异：通常重放严格晚于 Last-Event-ID 的事件，也有系统包含边界并依赖消费端去重。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "重放边界属于应用策略，不能替代文档说明。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "测试应固定所选重放边界规则并验证首个返回的 ID。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "严格续传测试应在游标附近构造事件，并断言所提供 ID 缺席而后继事件出现。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "EventSource 在连接丢失后会自动尝试重连，并采用指数退避策略。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "SSE 客户端重连时会在请求头中发送最后收到的事件 ID（Last-Event-ID）。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "Last-Event-ID 允许服务器从客户端断开处恢复流。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "SSE 在网络协议层会保持连接为“incomplete”状态。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "SSE 连接会随着事件发生持续追加新的 chunks。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "SSE 没有用于确认的返回路径。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "在 SSE 上实现确认需要应用层自行构建。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "在 SSE 上实现消息 ID 需要应用层自行构建。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "服务器需要追踪每个客户端已确认的内容，并在重连后重发其余内容。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "每个客户端需要代码来丢弃重复项。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "SSE 将排序保证留给应用层处理。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 0.0,
            "supported": false
          },
          {
            "text": "SSE 将去重保证留给应用层处理。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "来源[2]指出SSE的浏览器端重连会采用服务器设置的重试延迟。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "来源[2]指出SSE重连会携带Last-Event-ID。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "来源[2]指出服务器保留短事件缓冲时，SSE可据此无缺口恢复事件流。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "来源[2]指出原始WebSocket关闭后需要应用层进行指数退避重连。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 0.6,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "来源[2]指出原始WebSocket关闭后需要遗漏消息恢复。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "来源[2]指出长轮询保持的请求在规模下会像推送一样消耗服务器容量。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "来源[2]指出长轮询还承担逐消息重连开销。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "来源[2]称长轮询只作为回退层级。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 0.3,
            "supported": false
          },
          {
            "text": "来源[2]指出所有推送传输都需要代理配合。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 0.0,
            "supported": false
          },
          {
            "text": "来源[1]指出WebSocket是有状态传输。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "来源[1]指出WebSocket没有内置重连逻辑。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "来源[1]指出某些限制性企业代理和深度包检测防火墙可能阻断WebSocket协议。",
            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 1.0,
            "supported": true
          },
          {
            "text": "来源[1]描述服务器超时机制：若超时窗口内无事件，服务器发送204 No Content或类似响应，客户端重连。",
            "cited": true,
